    dc:modified '2024-08-23T15:47:12'^^xsd:dateTime ;
    skos:altLabel 'RDI WN 150 kHz DVL PS'^^xsd:string ;
    skos:prefLabel 'Teledyne RDI Workhorse Navigator 150 kHz Doppler velocity log and pressure sensor'@en ;
    skos:definition 'A Doppler velocity log (DVL) measuring bottom track and water track velocities, altitude, heading, tilt, temperature, echo intensity and pressure. 150 kHz Broadband signal processing gives high data resolution and a four-beam solution gives an independent error velocity measurement as an indicator of data quality. It has a bottom track range of 400 m and velocity accuracy for both bottom and water track modes is 0.4 % of the velocity, +/- 0.2 cm/s. The instrument operates effectively over a temperature range of -5 to 45 degC and with a tilt of up to +/- 15 deg.'@en ;
    skos:notation 'SDN:L22::TOOL0374'^^xsd:string .
<feed> tree:member <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/L22/current/TOOL0372/3/> .
